  "goodToKnow": "Die Vormundschaft is legal guardianship of a minor whose parents can't care for them, often held by the Jugendamt. For adults, Germany replaced guardianship in 1992 with die rechtliche Betreuung, which preserves more self-determination. Der Vormund is the guardian; Mund here once meant protection, not mouth. Bevormunden means to patronise. Plural: die Vormundschaften."
